GNU Emacs 31.1 lisp/ files, verbatim (not edited).

Origin: /usr/local/share/emacs/31.1/lisp/<path>.el.gz of a GNU Emacs 31.1
build, decompressed with zcat.  Each file sits at the same path it has under
lisp/ in the Emacs 31.1 source tree.  SHA256SUMS records the digest of every
file here (sha256sum format, paths relative to this directory).

Why a second tree: vendor/emacs-lisp is the GNU Emacs 30.1 lisp/ tree and must
not be edited, but the S2 feature-coverage reference is Emacs 31.1, whose
files define names 30.1 lacks.  The bootstrap manifest
(scripts/build-nelisp-bootstrap.el) lists these 31.1 files in place of the
30.1 ones where they load on the standalone.
